# cargo-cicd

`cargo-cicd` is a local-first CI/CD helper for Rust workspaces.
It keeps repositories clean, target directories under control, test runs focused on what changed,
and local state ready before CI runs.

## Install

```sh
cargo install cargo-cicd
```

